# --- Godot 4 ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor cache, import metadata, exported intermediate files. Includes
# .godot/export_credentials.cfg (NEVER commit — contains PCK encryption keys
# and platform signing creds) and .godot/exported/ (build cache, regenerated
# by every export).
.godot/
*.tmp
*.translation

# --- Vercel -----------------------------------------------------------------
# `.vercel/` — created by `vercel link` / `vercel pull`, holds project + org
#   IDs. Not secret but re-links per-machine.
# `.env*.local` — `vercel env pull` writes secrets here (API keys, tokens).
# `.vercel-output/` — output dir from `vercel build` (Build Output API).
# `.now/` — legacy Now.sh alias (Vercel CLI < v17), still occasionally
#   created when migrating from old configs.
.vercel/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.vercel-output/
.now/

# --- Web build outputs ------------------------------------------------------
# build/web/ ITSELF is committed so Vercel deploys the static export. Only
# scrub auto-generated import metadata Godot drops in there + dev artefacts.
build/web/*.import
build/web/.DS_Store

# --- Tooling ----------------------------------------------------------------
tools/catalog-editor/node_modules/
tools/catalog-editor/dist/

# --- OS / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
